<title>USA: Candie's extends warrants redemption date.</title>
<headline>Candie's extends warrants redemption date.</headline>
<dateline>PURCHASE, N.Y. 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Candie's Inc said Wednesday that it is extending to 1700 EDT/2100 GMT May 30 the redemption on its 1,457,000 outstanding redeemable Class B common stock purchase warrants at a price of $0.25 per warrant.</p>
<p>Each warrant entitles the holder to buy at a price of $4 one share of Candie's common stock.</p>
